═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Carve-outs (intentionally open-licensed)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The following components of this repository are released under
permissive licenses so the ecosystem can adopt the verification format
without committing to the platform. Each lists its own canonical
license file:

  1. /packages/vaos-verifier/                                MIT
     The reference implementation of the Verifiable Agent Output
     Specification (VAOS) 1.0 verifier. Zero dependencies. Designed
     to be vendored or installed via npm by any party that wants to
     verify a VAOS receipt without trusting Sovereign Matrix.

     Canonical license: /packages/vaos-verifier/LICENSE

  2. /docs/specs/vaos-1.0.md                                 CC0 1.0
     The Verifiable Agent Output Specification itself, released into
     the public domain. Implementations, extensions, and forks of the
     specification are encouraged. No attribution required.

  3. /cli/sovereign.mjs                                      MIT
     The npx-runnable verification CLI. Same intent as the verifier
     package — distribution should not require platform consent.

  4. /docs/outreach/                                         CC BY 4.0
     Outreach templates (cold emails, Loom scripts, blog posts,
     partnership pitches). Use with attribution; modify freely.

